# Ollama Configuration
# Set this to your Ollama server URL if running on a non-default host
# Default: http://localhost:11434
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434

# ============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT REQUIREMENTS
# ============================================================================
#
# Python: 3.12.10 (or compatible 3.12.x)
#
# GPU: NVIDIA RTX 3050 6GB — the card the reported results were produced on.
#      Model tested: DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B (8B parameters, the Qwen3
#      distillation of DeepSeek-R1), served through Ollama as `deepseek-r1:8b`.
#
# Dependencies: Install via `pip install -r requirements.txt`
#
# Ollama: Required for LLM inference
#         Install from https://ollama.ai
#         Pull the model: `ollama pull deepseek-r1:8b`
#         (`ollama run deepseek-r1:8b` also pulls it on first use)
#         The server runs on localhost:11434 by default
#
#         src/modeling/llms/config.py also maps `llama3.1:8b` as an
#         alternative tag, but no Llama results are reported in the thesis, altough at first it was intended.
#
# ============================================================================
